  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Government capacity to monitor and report SDGs under FAO`s custody</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">project?s objectives are consistent with FAO?s responsibilities as a custodian agency, as outlined in the 2017 Report of the IAEG-SDG to the Statistical Commission (par. 28) and recognized by UN Statistical Commission decision 48/101/k. FAO is equipped with Office of the Chief Statistician (OCS), established in December 2016, which works and sharpen the focus on fulfilling all duties pursuant to FAO?s role as a custodian for SDG indicators</narrative>
  </description>
